      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 499,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p5_b22",
      "text": "j\n, we partition the K candidates into a high-\nconfidence subset H and a low-confidence subset L. We\nconstruct a reliable teacher mask Pteacher \u2208[0, 1]H\u00d7W by\ncombining the predictions from H. A dynamically weighted\nMean Squared Error (MSE) is then applied to the candidates\nin L:\n",
      "bbox": [
